# ── Rhapsody ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated code and build output. Rhapsody writes it into a folder named after
# the component (e.g. DefaultComponent/DefaultConfig/). Convention for this repo:
# every Rhapsody component name ends in "Component".
model/**/*Component/
model/generated/

# Backups, autosave, logs, per-user workspace layout
model/**/*_bak*.rpyx
model/**/*_auto_rpy/
model/**/*.rpw
model/**/*.ehl
model/**/*.log
model/**/*.~*
# NOTE: verify these against the files Rhapsody 9.0 actually writes once the
# project exists (run `git status` after the first save and adjust).

# ── C++ / Visual Studio ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.ipch
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.idb
*.tlog

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# ── Editors / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ── Large media (keep out of git) ─────────────────────────────────────────
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
